OL,3,GNEWSAGary Numan announced as festival
OL,4,Aheadliner
OL,5,
OL,6,FSynth-pop singer songwriter Gary Numan
OL,7,Fis set to headline a Somerset festival
OL,8,Fas it returns for its second year.
OL,10,FElectric Summer, a one day festival,
OL,11,Fwill be held in Vivary Park in Taunton
OL,12,Fon Sunday 29 August and will also
OL,13,Finclude acts Little Boots, Tiny
OL,14,FMagnetic Pets and Tin Gun.
OL,16,FNuman, whose hits include 'Cars' and
OL,17,F'Are Friends Electric?', began his
OL,18,Fcareer more than four decades ago after
OL,19,Fbreaking through in 1979 with his band
OL,20,FTubeway Army.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
