OL,3,GNEWSAGary Numan announced as festival
OL,4,Aheadliner
OL,5,
OL,6,FJez Damsell, director of Souvenir
OL,7,FEvents and curator of the festival,
OL,8,Fsaid they "were totally bowled over by
OL,9,Fthe universally positive feedback we
OL,10,Freceived from our inaugural event this
OL,11,Fsummer".
